      "long_description": "Neuromorphic is building an embodiment-agnostic “brain” that makes robots fast to deploy, adaptable across different bodies, and easy to manage through natural interfaces like Slack, email, and phone.  Our goal is to make deploying robots in wet labs and other physical industries as easy as onboarding a new employee.",
